```
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                          Codebase Target Path                          |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                    |
            +-----------------------+-----------------------+
            |                       |                       |
            v                       v                       v
      CPU Thread 1            CPU Thread 2           CPU Thread N
  (ast.parse batch 1)     (ast.parse batch 2)     (ast.parse batch N)
